{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"射影空间"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"射影空间 (代数几何)"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>线性空间的射影空间是直线的"},{"Local":{"url":"模空间","text":"模空间"}},{"Plain":", 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"乘法群概形","text":"$\\mathbb G_m$"}},{"Plain":"-作用的商.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>射影空间 $\\mathbb P^n$ 是 $\\mathbb{Z}[x_0,x_1,\\cdots,x_n]$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"射影谱","text":"射影谱"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>射影空间上的线丛</h3>\n<p>$O(1)$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"正线丛","text":"正线丛"}},{"Plain":", 又称"},{"Local":{"url":"超平面丛","text":"超平面丛"}},{"Plain":", 其"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":"是 $1$ 次齐次多项式.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"重言丛","text":"重言丛"}},{"Plain":"是 $O(1)$ 的对偶 $O(-1)$.</p>\n"}]}}